        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uzia omukama wa Yuda.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Yuda boona, bakakwata Uziya ow'emyaka ikumi na mukaaga, nuwe baata ha ngoma y'Amaziya, ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Amaziya obu yamazire kufa, Uziya nuwe yayombekere buhyaka orubuga Elosi, yarugarurra Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya kuteera engoma, akaba ahikize emyaka ikumi na mukaaga, akalemera emyaka amakumi ataano n'ebiri omu rubuga Yerusaalemu. Ibara lya nyina nuwe Yekoliya, owa Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora ebirukusemeza MUKAMA, byona Amaziya ise, ebi yakozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu businge bwa Zekaliya ayamwegeseze kutiina Ruhanga, akaheereza Ruhanga; n'obwesige, akasumi koona aka yaherererizeemu MUKAMA, MUKAMA Ruhanga akamuha omugisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaramaga yarwanisa Abafirisiti, yaseesa ebisiika by'embuga: Gaasi, Yabune n'Asidodi; yayombeka embuga omunsi y'Asidodi na handi, hagati y'Abafirisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga akamukonyera kurwanisa Abafirisiti, n'Abaharabu abaikaraga Gurubaali, n'Abamehuuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamooni baaha Uziya omusoro, kandi yaranganwa okuhikira kimu ha mutaano gwa Misiri, habwokuba akaba ali w'amaani muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ekindi, omu rubuga Yerusaalemu, ha Irembo erya ha Keekubo n'erya ha Kihanga, na ha Bukiizi, akombekayo eminaara yagizitirra n'amabaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi akombeka eminaara omwirungu, yalima amaziba maingi, habwokuba, akaba aina amahyo maingi omu bihanga n'omu byeya; kandi akaba aina abalimi n'abanogorozi b'emizabbibbu, omu nsozi n'omunsi ez'orwezo, habwokuba yagonzaaga ebyobulimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekindi, Uziya akaba aina ihe ery'abaserikale abarukusobora kurwana obulemu, babaganiziibwemu ekihanda, okurorra ha muhendo Yeyeri omuhandiiki, na Maaseya omunyoro ogu baabazire, nibeebemberwa Hananiya, omu ha ngabwa z'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhendo gwona ogw'abakuru b'amaju aga baisenkurubo, ogw'abasaija ab'amaani emanzi, bakaba bali enkumi ibiri omu rukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaba nibalema ihe ery'abantu obusiiriira busatu mu kasanju n'ebitaano, abakaba nibasobora kurwana obucwekaihembe bakonyere omukama wabo kurwanisa abanyanzigwa be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya, ihe lyona akaliha: yabaha engabu, amacumu, enkufiira, ebizibaho eby'ebyoma, obuta, n'amabaale ag'okuhunguza emyesuuso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu rubuga Yerusaalemu, yakoramu ebyoma ebyazoirwe abantu abanyamagezi, bibege omu minaara na ha bwekubo, birasege emisogi, kandi bihungulege amabaale amakooto. Yaranganwa muno habwokuba, akakoonyerwa muno Ruhanga okuhika obu yabaire w'amaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uziya Naafubirwa Habw'Emyehembo ye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu yamazire kufooka w'amaani yataahwamu emyekuliirizo eki nikyo kyamurugiiremu okuhwerekerra. Habwokuba akagaya MUKAMA, Ruhanga we yataaha omunju ya MUKAMA yacumikira obubbaani ha itambiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Azaliya nyakatagara, akamukuraatira, ali hamu na banyakatagara ba MUKAMA kinaana, abasaija emanzi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 30:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baamutanga nibamugambira bati, “Uziya, kucumiikirirra MUKAMA obubbaani, tiguli mulimo gwawe, mulimo gwabanyakatagara; batabani b'Arooni, nubo baayereziibwe kukora omulimo ogu. Ruga omu kiikaro ekirukwera; habwokuba okozire kubi, kandi eki, MUKAMA Ruhanga tarukwija kukikuheera kitiinisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya nukwo kubiihirwa. Omu kasumi ako, akaba akwasire ekiswa eky'okucumiikiriirramu obubbaani, obu yabiihiirirwe banyakatagara, ha buso bwe, hatyeerukaho ebigenge, abanyakatagara nibarora bati, bali omunju ya MUKAMA, haihi n'itambiro ericumiikiriirwaho obubbaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaliya nyakatagara omukuru, na banyakatagara abandi boona, baamusimba eriiso, kumwetegereza, ebigenge bimutyerukire ha buso! Baamuturukya aheeru bwango, na uwe wenka yarahuka bwango aturuke, habwokuba MUKAMA nuwe akaba amutiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Uziya akaikara ali mugenge okuhiha okufa kwe, habwokuba mugenge, yaraaraga omunju eyesunguswiire habwokuba, akaba naatangwa kutaaha omunju ya MUKAMA. Mutabani we Yosamu, yarolerra kaaruziika y'omukama, yalema n'abantu ab'ensi egi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebindi Uziya ebi yakozire, okurugirra ha ky'okubanza okugarukira ha ky'okumalirra, Isaaya omurangi mutabani w'Amozi, nuwe yabihandiikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.6.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 6:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya akatuuza yatabaazibwa hamu na baisenkuru omu itaka eryatabaazibwamuga abakama, baitu habwokuba mugenge, atatabaazibwe omu magasani g'abakama. Mutabani we Yosamu, yalema omu kiikaro kye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
